---
title: "Contacto | Aitor Soluciones"
description: "Pide valoración por WhatsApp, llamada o formulario. Jardinería y mantenimiento de propiedades en Alcanar y alrededores."
layout: layouts/base.njk
---
{% import "components/breadcrumbs.njk" as bc %}
{% import "components/hero.njk" as heroc %}
{% import "components/cta.njk" as ctac %}
{% import "components/form.njk" as formc %}
{% import "components/jsonld.njk" as ld %}

{% set waLinkContacto = business.whatsapp | waLink(business.waMessageDefault) %}
{% set breadcrumbItems = [{ label: "Inicio", url: "/" }, { label: "Contacto", url: "/contacto/" }] %}

<script type="application/ld+json">{{ ld.breadcrumbSchema(business, breadcrumbItems) | safe }}</script>

<div class="container">{{ bc.breadcrumbs(breadcrumbItems) }}</div>

{{ heroc.pageHero("Contacto", "Pide tu valoración", business.ctaSupportMessage, waLinkContacto, "contacto") }}

<section class="section"><div class="container contact-box">
<div>
<span class="eyebrow">Vías de contacto</span>
<h2>WhatsApp, llamada o formulario</h2>
<p class="lead">WhatsApp es la vía más rápida: envía 2 o 3 fotos, la localidad y qué necesitas.</p>
<div class="cta-row">{{ ctac.whatsappCta(waLinkContacto, "Abrir WhatsApp", "contacto_main") }}{{ ctac.phoneCta(business.phone, business.phoneDisplay, "contacto_main") }}</div>
<p style="margin-top:24px"><strong>Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:{{ business.email }}">{{ business.email }}</a><br><strong>Base:</strong> {{ business.base }}</p>
</div>
{{ formc.leadForm("", "") }}
</div></section>
